has-ties-to-chinese-fund-manager-facing-criminal-scrutiny-102503139.html?cxg=web&Sfrom=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/aeXcNheo4F"}]}, "id": "2120172538965950561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6675, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Caixin In Depth: Chinese Woman Linked to Nvidia CEO Has Ties to Shady Shanghai Fund Manager https://t.co/aeXcNheo4F", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2120172538965950561"}, {"author_id": "499603787", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:31:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120162487265886518"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 185, "id": "86364947", "start": 174, "username": "HooverInst"}]}, "id": "2120162487265886518", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 10388, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "One alarming dynamic in U.S./China relationship is the absence of moderating voices on the Chinese side. There are only “America hawks” in the Chinese system, Matt Turpin of @HooverInst told me—“no ‘America doves.’” That’s even more pronounced under Xi’s consolidation of power,", "url": "https://x.com/Lingling_Wei/status/2120162487265886518"}, {"author_id": "423769635", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:20:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120159685764350266"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 104, "id": "3108351", "start": 100, "username": "WSJ"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kIR76r3zPO", "end": 128, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2120159685764350266/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120159651127812098", "start": 105, "url": "https://t.co/kIR76r3zPO"}]}, "id": "2120159685764350266", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 4796, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "The US cattle herd has fallen to its smallest level in 75 years, constraining beef supply.\n\nSource: @WSJ https://t.co/kIR76r3zPO", "url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2120159685764350266"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:18:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120159280355828165"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EfuanarKM2", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2120159280355828165/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120157766774091776", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/EfuanarKM2"}]}, "id": "2120159280355828165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 28162, "like_count": 120, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 42, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "There was no Oct. 2025 CPI (Gov't shutdown) so no y/y CPI with today Oct. 2026 release.\n\nBlack line below is the CORE CPI 11-month annualized rate. It ROSE to 2.92%.\n\nOrange line is the last 3-month annualized rate. At 3.75%, a 2 1/2 year high. \n\nCore inflation is a problem! https://t.co/EfuanarKM2", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2120159280355828165"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:12:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120157586733326384"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mtkonczal/stat…", "end": 119, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mtkonczal/status/2120149208338686137", "start": 96, "url": "https://t.co/RZCxhShWtw"}]}, "id": "2120157586733326384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 32710, "like_count": 420, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 38}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120149208338686137", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Usually there's a way to slice a CPI report so that you have some kind of glimmer of good news. https://t.co/RZCxhShWtw", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120157586733326384"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:01:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120154765069787268"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FHn16MrkDP", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120154765069787268/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120154760670003200", "start": 0, "url": "https://t.co/FHn16MrkDP"}, {"display_url": "x.com/BenjySarlin/st…", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/BenjySarlin/status/2120154292736987188", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/ku5YXWkh3J"}]}, "id": "2120154765069787268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 17233, "like_count": 90, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120154292736987188", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "https://t.co/FHn16MrkDP https://t.co/ku5YXWkh3J", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120154765069787268"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:58:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120154244695109783"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 45, "start": 36, "tag": "Moonshot"}, {"end": 190, "start": 187, "tag": "AI"}]}, "id": "2120154244695109783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1278, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "READ THIS ONE WHILE SITTING DOWN:\n\n\"#Moonshot AI accessed a trove of Nvidia’s most advanced chips this summer, according to documents filed w/Beijing regulators, highlighting the Chinese #AI champion’s reliance on American hardware despite US export restrictions.\n\nThe firm behind", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2120154244695109783"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:57:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120153756973310061"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Lu7LBMwnwF", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120153756973310061/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120153732478369793", "start": 178, "url": "https://t.co/Lu7LBMwnwF"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 225, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2118705588280479823", "start": 202, "url": "https://t.co/5C2LYNsyoc"}]}, "id": "2120153756973310061", "public_metrics": {"bo