imes.com/interactive/2026/11/09/science/trump-funding-cuts-young-scientists-phd-research.html?smid=tw-share", "images": [{"height": 1687, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120111773617455104/frKjE9BF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 3000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120111773617455104/frKjE9BF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 42, "status": 200, "title": "Trump-Era Funding Cuts Driving Young Scientists From U.S. Research", "unwound_url": "https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2026/11/09/science/trump-funding-cuts-young-scientists-phd-research.html?smid=tw-share", "url": "https://t.co/sIuPzIw997"}]}, "id": "2120148908986744925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2706, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "The U.S. Is Driving Away Young Scientists https://t.co/sIuPzIw997", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2120148908986744925"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:36:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120148537090670872"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UhmbJFWZCd", "end": 68, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120148537090670872/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120148530945810432", "start": 45, "url": "https://t.co/UhmbJFWZCd"}]}, "id": "2120148537090670872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 19823, "like_count": 141, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "2-year yield spike after hot inflation print https://t.co/UhmbJFWZCd", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120148537090670872"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:34:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147968468955555"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Connecting decision makers to a dynamic network of information, people and ideas, Bloomberg quickly and accurately delivers business and financial information, news and insight around the world Connecting decision makers to a dyn amic network of information, people and ideas, Bloomberg quickly and accurately delivers business and financial information, news and insight around the", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/live-blog…", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/live-blog/2026-11-10/us-cpi-report-for-october-live-updates?srnd=homepage-americas&cursorId=6AF31CCA4A080000", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120147973019672577/CBoFqf6Q?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120147973019672577/CBoFqf6Q?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 165, "status": 200, "title": "US CPI Report for October: Live Coverage and Analysis", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/live-blog/2026-11-10/us-cpi-report-for-october-live-updates?srnd=homepage-americas&cursorId=6AF31CCA4A080000", "url": "https://t.co/kSULJJav9d"}]}, "id": "2120147968468955555", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 19977, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "🔥🔥🔥\n\n\"Both the headline and core are higher than expected and, critically, core met the threshold that Fed Governor Waller laid out for a larger 50 bps rate hike.\"\n\nhttps://t.co/kSULJJav9d", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120147968468955555"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:33:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147923157540959"], "id": "2120147923157540959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 17343, "like_count": 92, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "As a reminder, there will be no y/y CPI reading given the government shutdown a year ago when CPI wasn’t released", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2120147923157540959"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:33:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147833906934250"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 36, "start": 26, "tag": "inflation"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ATg0HYhrNy", "end": 149, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2120147833906934250/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120147811752640512", "start": 126, "url": "https://t.co/ATg0HYhrNy"}]}, "id": "2120147833906934250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 12364, "like_count": 80, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "In m/m terms, October CPI #inflation +0.4% vs. +0.3% est. &amp; +0.6% prior … core CPI +0.3% vs. +0.2% est. &amp; +0.3% prior https://t.co/ATg0HYhrNy", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2120147833906934250"}, {"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:04:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120140578042310945"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ITS2sBhVLV", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2120140578042310945/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120140534312542209", "start": 260, "url": "https://t.co/ITS2sBhVLV"}]}, "id": "2120140578042310945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 24841, "like_count": 139, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 45, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "In the last 2+ weeks, Brent Crude Oil (blue) has declined 22%, from $116.72 on October 23rd to $90.56 today.\n\nBut the 10-year yield (black) has declined by only 10 basis points (from 4.99% on Oct 23 to 4.89% today).\n\nThe bond market is NOT about crude prices. https://t.co/ITS2sBhVLV", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2120140578042310945"}, {"author_id": "3311286493", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:02:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120140062872813800"], "id": "2120140062872813800", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 19050, "like_count": 146, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "一 个美女 间 谍\nNot often that intermediate vocab is this topical!", "url": "https://x.com/adam_tooze/status/2120140062872813800"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:49:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120136641511653625"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/RenMacLLC/stat…", "end": 242, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/RenMacLLC/status/2119437625639551342", "start": 219, "url": "https://t.co/68WhrrX7ZM"}]}, "id": "2120136641511653625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1906, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119437625639551342", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sadly for everyone, I'm not Neil Dutta, but I had the opportunity to pinch-hit for him on last week's RenMac Off-Script podcast.  \n\nVery grateful to Neil, Jeff DeGraaf, and the rest of the RenMac team for having me on! https://t.co/68WhrrX7ZM", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2120136641511653625"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T12:30:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120131944952602743"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Federal Reserve Governor Christopher Waller on Tuesday said he supports an interest-rate hike in December, and warned that if inflation continues to accelerate he would support a half-percentage-point increase to protect the central bank’s credibility.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/fed-s-waller-backs-december-rate-hike-says-open-to-larger-move?srnd=homepage-americas&sref=vuYGislZ", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120131948014387200/1iIdVa26?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120131948014387200/1iIdVa26?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "Fed’s Waller Backs December Rate Hike, Open to Larger Move", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-1